  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Port Sudan Power/Water Desalinat Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the study is to determine if it is feasible to supply Port Sudan, Suakin and environs with electric power and potable water at an affordable cost by means of a seawater desalting plant up to the year 2010.</narrative>
  </description>
